title: $:/mf/gen/GUI command/path-ref:list-refs
catalog: GUI command
target: path-ref:list-refs
summary: Path-ref explorer: list the metarecords pointing at the selected node (here / other / new) [replace / and]

!! Reference

* Defined by the ``path-ref`` panel

!! Default keys

* ``b p l`` → ``path-ref:list-refs other`` (in the ``path-ref`` panel)
* ``i p l`` → ``path-ref:list-refs here`` (in the ``path-ref`` panel)
* ``n p l`` → ``path-ref:list-refs new`` (in the ``path-ref`` panel)
* ``p l`` → ``path-ref:list-refs other`` (in the ``path-ref`` panel)
